                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (G,T)\mapsto (T,t)\mapsto (LTrans(T),t)
            produces a torsor
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
